# workestrate single tool home (ADR 0023) — bind-mount .workestrate/ for persistence.
# Note: the SOPS age private key is intentionally NOT placed under .workestrate/
# (or anywhere in the repo). It stays at ~/.config/sops/age/ on the host.
# workestrate secret operations run on the host; in the container the key is
# absent and secret ops fail closed by design.
use flake
export CARGO_TARGET_DIR="${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}/ai-workbench/agentctl-target"
# unify bare-cargo/flycheck with just cache (see justfile:5)
